t=\"794\" data-end=\"797\"><strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"817\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> Bosch Professional 18V gereedschappen<br data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"858\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"868\">Kleur:</strong> Blauw / Zwart<br data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"885\"><strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"895\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"964\">📦 <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"935\">Bosch ProCORE18V 4.0Ah Accu</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1023\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"988\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"991\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
